---
description: Authentication authorization security and privacy
alwaysApply: true
---

Deny by default. A UI role, hidden control, UUID, or client check is never authorization.
Future sensitive operations require authenticated server authority and direct negative tests.
Minimize PII, never expose secrets, and retain qualified legal review gates from the constitution.
Requirements: `PP-AUTH-001`, `PP-SEC-001`, `PP-SEC-002`, `PP-SEC-003`, `PP-SEC-004`.
